r-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"container align-center\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-white col-md-10\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The video production company crafting beautiful&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">films built around your real marketing needs.</span></h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\">You’ve shaped your business slowly, with a lot of thought and care. Growing it shouldn't mean compromising your taste or worrying about social media.We take your marketing goals and translate them into honest, down-to-earth videos that quietly do the hard work for your brand online. We handle all the scripting, planning, and make you feel relaxed on camera, so you can stop worrying about what to post and stay present in the real world work you love.<div></div></h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">How? Videos, the kind that make your ideal audience watch and take action, while you relax and enjoy the process. Whether it's for your website, social media or an event. We combine, strategy, storytelling, filmmaking craft and&nbsp;a stress free framework, so your videos reach the right people and grow your business.<br><br>Hi! We’re Katy and Eugene, you can get a proper intro here.<br></p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-white\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">View Videographer Services<br></a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-if=\"showArrow\" class=\"mbr-arrow hidden-sm-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <a href=\"#next\">\n            <i class=\"mbri-down mbr-iconfont\"></i>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</section>",
