v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Locations<div></div></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>While we can work anywhere, we spend most of our time in a few key places. Having lived and worked in these areas throughout the years, we've built up an amazing network of local clients.<br><br>Portugal <br>Based here full-time, locations include Lisbon, Porto and Coimbra&nbsp;<br><br>South Africa <br>We spend part of the year here, locations include Cape Town and Johannesburg<br><br>UK <br>We visit the UK regularly, for work, with our main focus around London<br><br>Kenya <br>Another regular destination for client work, from Nairobi to Kisii<br><br>If you are interested in any of these locations, don't hesitate to drop us a message to discuss.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
