v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><br>Malawi &amp; Mayamiko<br><br></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Malawi<br>The story of Mayamiko begins in Malawi, a small, beautiful country in Southern Africa. When Maria, the founder of Mayamiko, first visited Malawi, she came across the chitenje fabric, a traditional textile worn by many people in the region. There was something magical about the patterns, the energy of these fabrics.<br><br>Maria wanted to use this beautiful tradition to create something that would not only celebrate Malawi’s rich culture but also contribute to the economic growth of the local community. And so, Mayamiko was born, fashion with a purpose.<br><br>Ethical Fashion<br>Mayamiko isn’t just a fashion brand, Maria wanted to build a brand that didn’t just focus on style, but also on the well-being of the people behind the scenes and the planet that sustains us.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
