v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Mayamiko and Sustainable Fashion</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>1. What makes Mayamiko’s clothing sustainable?<br>Mayamiko’s clothing is made from handpicked fabrics sourced from local Malawian markets and organic producers. Their solar-powered workshop and zero-waste philosophy ensure that each piece is crafted with the environment in mind.<br><br>2. How does Mayamiko empower women?<br>Mayamiko provides sewing and business training to disadvantaged women in Malawi, helping them become entrepreneurs and seamstresses. Graduates of the program are given the opportunity to buy their own sewing machines with 70% of the cost covered by Mayamiko.<br><br>3. What does #LovedClothesLast mean?<br>#LovedClothesLast is a movement encouraging the purchase of timeless, durable clothing. Mayamiko designs pieces that are built to last, promoting sustainable consumption and reducing the environmental impact of fast fashion.<br><br>4. What kind of products does Mayamiko offer?<br>Mayamiko offers a wide range of products, including organic denim, handwoven blankets, knits, and accessories. They also have a collection of home decor items like table runners and cushion covers—all made with sustainable materials.<br><br>5. How can video help my sustainable brand tell its story?<br>Video storytelling is an incredible tool to showcase your brand’s impact and connect with your audience on a personal level. At Munjiri Videos, we help sustainable brands craft meaningful video content that highlights their values, mission, and the people behind their brand.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
