v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Services<div></div></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Every videography project is completely flexible and tailored to fit your specific needs, goals, and timeline. From drone footage to events, here are some examples of what we can do.<br><br>Brand Video Production<br>This is for you if you want a beautiful, moving video right at the top of your website homepage, if you are getting ready to open the doors to a brand-new project, or if you want a mini-documentary that tells the story behind why you do what you do.<br><br>Social Media Video Packages<br>A creative partnership for busy founders who are sick of the endless social media slog, but still want to show up online regularly while saving time for the work they love.<br><br>Travel &amp; Lifestyle Videography<br>This is for you if you run a boutique hotel, an eco-lodge, an interior brand, or create beautiful lifestyle products, and you want to capture the real experience of your space or your pieces.<br><br>Charity &amp; Impact Films<br>This is for you if you manage a grassroots organization, an NGO, or a social enterprise and want to turn complex issues into honest human stories that get supporters to donate, volunteer, and act.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
