v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Process<div></div></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Getting to Know You &amp; Planning<br>We never let high-quality footage go to waste on an unclear message. With a notepad in hand, we’ll dive deep into your business to research your audience and map out a single, powerful objective. Before a single camera turns on, you’ll get a rock-solid storytelling structure built around a proven marketing framework, along with a practical production plan covering all the locations, custom shot lists, and tailored interview questions.<br><br>A Relaxed Filming Day<br>Shoot day should feel completely stress-free, not intimidating. Because everything is already planned and prepared, we show up early to set up a relaxed, natural environment for you and your team. Our crew handles all the technical heavy lifting behind the scenes—including precise framing, sound, lighting, and cinematic colour—while giving you supportive on-camera guidance to help everyone stop \"performing\" and just be themselves.<br><br>Editing, Delivery &amp; Strategy<br>This is where your story really comes together. Over coffee and computer time, we intentionally shape your raw footage into a tight, engaging narrative, adding premium video polish, flowing visuals, and matching music. We’ll work closely with you through a collaborative review process to refine the details until it's just right, handing over final master files ready for your website or socials, alongside a custom sharing strategy guide to make sure it reaches the right people.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
