   <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">&nbsp;Our Video Production Process</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Videographer Portugal</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Product - Find out exactly what you're selling and how it helps people.<br><br>Audience - Research who we are making this video for and what problems they're facing.<br><br>Stories - We listen to your stories, the highs, the lows, the little details.<br><br>Structure - Give your video a clear shape, create interview questions and shot lists.<br><br>Film and Audio - Filming time! Throughout the video production process we carefully consider colour, light, framing and sound that build the world your audience can step into.<br><br>Edit - Pick the very best moments, follow the story arc, cut, cut, cut, and add music and audio.<br><br>Send - You’ll get your finished video or videos, plus info on how and where to use them.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
