v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">A Note From Katy and Eugene</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Videographer Portugal</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>If you’re looking for a videographer in Portugal who clarifies your goals, brings your vision to life, and delivers results, we’d love to help! With 8+ years of experience, we’ve worked with many clients who come back again and again. With our experience in storytelling, production, and strategy, we guide every project, while keeping the process relaxed.<br><br>“Working with you two was just about the easiest collaborative process I could have ever imagined. You were incredibly relaxed… and professional. I look forward to continuing to work with Munjiri Videos as the school continues to grow.”<br>— Olivia Fite, Collective Wonder Herb School<br><br>“We absolutely loved working with Katy and Eugene…We would highly recommend them and will definitely work with them again.”<br>— Julie Hadley, The Heartfelt Project<br><br>We only take on a handful of projects at a time, so you get our full attention. If this approach feels right for you, you can message me here, with any questions.<br><br>katy@munjiri.com</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n     