ackground-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-10 align-center\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Learn Video Making</h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\"></h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">If you want to start making videos but feel a bit stuck or unsure where to begin, you're not alone. At <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-info\">Munjiri Videos</a>, we work with solo creators, small teams, and purpose-led brands to make the whole video-making thing feel simple and doable. Our Learn Video Making sessions are all about helping you feel more confident, get clear on your message, and learn the practical skills to bring your story to life in a way that feels true to you.​<br></p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
