   <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Social Media Video Production Mistakes, What We've Learnt</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Social media video production doesn’t have to be complicated, but it does require some thought and care. Avoiding these common mistakes, like overcomplicating your message, skipping planning, or chasing trends that don’t fit your brand, will help you create videos that connect with your audience and grow your presence steadily.<br><br>If you’re looking for support to make your social media videos truly shine, check out our <a href=\"http://www.munjiri.com\" class=\"text-info\">work</a>. We make beautiful, story-led films that are <a href=\"creative-video-productions.html\" class=\"text-info\">built with strategy</a>, so they actually work online. <br><br>Remember, the best videos come from keeping it simple, being helpful, telling stories, and staying true to your brand. With that approach, your social media video production will set you up for long-term success.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
