v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Social Media Video Ideas: A Challenge&nbsp;</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>People love watching someone try something new or tough and wondering, “Will they pull it off?” It’s all about the surprise and seeing real effort, which makes it <a href=\"make-storytelling-video.html\" class=\"text-info\">feel genuine and fun</a>.<br>Making mistakes and figuring things out on the spot, that kind of real stuff is exactly what people want to see.<br>Here are some tips for your own challenge videos:<br>Pick a challenge that fits what you do but has a bit of a challenge or risk to keep it interesting.<br>Show your honest reactions, whether you’re frustrated, excited, or shocked.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
