"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-10 align-center\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">The Best Way to Upload Video on YouTube: A Complete Checklist</h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Munjiri Videos</a></h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Don't waste time trying to memorize YouTube's upload settings. Grab our exact 1-page step-by-step checklist to keep open on your desktop every time you publish.<br><br>Download the Free 1-Page PDF<br><br>This blog covers the best way to upload video on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com\" class=\"text-info\">YouTube</a> with a thorough checklist to help your videos stand out.<br>Imagine you’ve just poured your heart into creating an <a href=\"brand-video-production.html\" class=\"text-info\">amazing video</a>. You hit upload on YouTube, expecting views, likes, and comments. But days later... crickets. Why did your great content get lost in the noise?<br>If you’ve ever felt this way, you’re not alone. Uploading your video to YouTube is more than just hitting the upload button.<br></p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
