 add tags when uploading a video?</div><br><div>Yes, adding relevant tags with keywords helps YouTube categorize your video correctly, making it easier for the right audience to find it.</div><br><div><br></div><div>Q4: Can I schedule my YouTube video uploads?</div><br><div>Absolutely! Scheduling your videos to go live at specific times can help you reach your audience when they are most active, boosting views and engagement.</div><div><br></div><div>Q5: Is it necessary to add video chapters?</div><br><div>Adding video chapters improves viewer experience by allowing users to jump to specific parts of the video. It also enhances your video's SEO, making it part of the best way to upload video on YouTube strategy.</div><div><br></div><br><div>Q6: How do I choose the best title for my YouTube video?</div><br><div>Choose a clear, keyword-rich title that accurately reflects the content. Research popular titles in your niche for inspiration while keeping it natural and engaging.</div><br><br><div><br></div><div><br></div></h3>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center py-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
