v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">What Factors Affect Videography Costs in Portugal</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Videography pricing isn’t one-size-fits-all. Several factors influence how much a videographer charges:<br><br>Project Type: Corporate videos, social impact videos, travel content, or events all require different planning, equipment, and post-production.<br>Crew Size &amp; Equipment: A solo videographer costs less than a full production team with <a href=\"drone-videographer.html\" class=\"text-info\">drones</a>, gimbals, and professional <a href=\"video-advice-natural-light.html\" class=\"text-info\">lighting</a>.<br>Location &amp; Travel: Shooting across Lisbon, Porto, or remote destinations may include travel, lodging, or permit fees.<br>Duration &amp; Deliverables: <a href=\"social-media-videography.html\" class=\"text-info\">Short social media clips</a> cost less than long-form documentaries or multi-day shoots.<br>Editing &amp; Post-Production: Color grading, motion graphics, and sound design can significantly impact the final price.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
