v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Average Videographer Rates in Lisbon &amp; Portugal</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Here’s an accurate guide to videography costs in Portugal, based on real data:<br><br>Freelance Videographer\t€300–€800 per project/day\t<br>Ideal for small projects, social media content, or personal videos<br><br>Mid-Level Production Company\t€800–€2,000 per project/day\t<br>Includes camera operator, basic editing, and sound<br><br>Full-Service Production Company\t€2,000–€5,000+ per project/day\t<br>Large corporate, tourism, or charity campaigns with full crew and post-production<br><br>Event Videography\t€150–€1,400 per event\t<br>Average around €400–€800 depending on duration and deliverables<br><br><a href=\"wedding-videographer-portugal.html\" class=\"text-info\">Wedding Videography</a>\t€450–€2,500+\t<br>Full-day coverage with cinematic editing<br><br>Video Editing Only\t€100–€1,500+\t<br>Price varies with complexity, length, and deliverables<br><br>Tip: Always clarify what’s included, some videographers may quote a lower day rate but charge extra for editing, travel, or equipment.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
