v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Video Production Kenya Team</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>We’re Katy and Eugene, a filmmaking team offering purpose-led videography across Kenya and beyond.<br><br>We met in South Luangwa, Zambia, and quickly saw a pattern: the people and organisations doing the most meaningful work were often the least visible. That didn’t feel right to us. So, we combined our love for creating beautiful visuals with storytelling and marketing and started making videos for them.<br><br>Since then, we’ve filmed in Kenya, Malawi, South Africa, Portugal, the UK, and more. We’ve worked with nonprofits, ethical homeware brands, nature organisations, and local makers. One of our videos was even shared by Michelle Obama with her 56.9 million followers.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
