   <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The real reason it is hard to turn website visitors into bookings<div></div></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>The real reason you're struggling to turn website visitors into bookings isn't a lack of effort. It's the idea that you have to choose between being invisible online or creating content that feels loud, salesy, and nothing like your brand.<br><br>Most marketing advice tells you to chase trends or copy what everyone else is doing. In the process, it misses what your guests are actually paying for: the feeling, the experience, and the sense of escape.<br><br>If you don't fix it, you'll keep spending valuable time on content that doesn't bring in the right guests.<br>You end up doing more marketing and less of what you do best, creating amazing experiences.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
