v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">What’s Included in Our Event Videographer Service</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Before the big day, we’ll chat with you to figure out what you want your video to capture, whether it’s a feeling, a message, or both. We’ll make sure your video has a clear purpose, whether you’re planning to promote something, share it with your guests, or just keep the memories alive.<br><br>Everything You Need, Start to Finish<br><br>We’ve got the whole process covered:<br>A pre-event call to hear what you’re hoping for<br>Help with scripting or event planning if you need it<br>Professional filming with top-notch equipment<br>Multiple camera angles (and drone shots if it fits!)<br>Filming every key moment on the day<br>Editing magic: music, sound, color, and finishing touches<br>Final videos just the way you want: full recap, highlights, or even a livestream<br><br>Videos That Fit Your Event<br><br>No matter what you’re planning, we’ll make a video that feels right for your event:<br>Corporate events: launches, conferences, team get-togethers<br>Social gatherings: weddings, birthdays, family celebrations<br>Creative &amp; community events: festivals, fundraisers, exhibitions, live shows<br>Brand activations: pop-ups, influencer events, product demos<br>Every event is different, and we make sure your video captures exactly what makes yours special.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
