          "_name": "content5",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section content5\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"8\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background4.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#fffcfa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Videographer Coimbra, Video Production That<div></div></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>It's tough to find a creative videographer or video production team that also understands the business and marketing side of things.<br>You're busy running a company, so you don't have time to work with a team whose communication, process and pricing isn't clear.<br>You also don't want a robotic, corporate video that doesn't feel true to you or your brand.<br><br>That’s where we come in, we’re Katy and Eugene, based just 30 mins from Coimbra in the beautiful Portuguese countryside. We combine beautiful filmmaking craft with video marketing knowledge. We handle everything with our simple, but effective videography process. Keeping things down to earth and human with our documentary style camera work and helping you feel as relaxed as possible on camera.<br><br>We have over 8 years experience and have worked with small businesses and grassroots organisations as well as more known names like CNBC and Michelle Obama. Ready to let your videos do the hard work for you, while you focus on running your business?<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">contact</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
