           <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Videographer Production Coimbra</span></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>We're Katy and Eugene, two videographers, who handle the entire process, from research and strategy to planning, filming, editing, and delivery, so you can stay focused on running your business. Every video is built around a clear message and designed to connect with the right people, not just look nice. Our documentary-style approach helps you come across naturally, showing the human and relatable side of your business instead of creating something over done and corporate. You'll always know what's happening, because of our clear communication and pricing. And because we're based just 30 minutes from Coimbra, in the beautiful Portuguese countryside, you get the convenience of working with a local team.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">portfolio</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
