   <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Videographer Coimbra Process</span></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Research&nbsp;<br>Wapping out the trusty notepad we research what you are selling, how it helps people and who it's for?<br><br>Planning&nbsp;<br>We take all this research and put it into a structure (hook, problem, solution and result) as well as planning all the details for filming, logistics, locations, equipment, shot lists and interview questions.<br><br>Filming<br>Up early for filming, we carefully consider, framing, sound, lighting, colour whilst making you and your team feel as comfortable on camera as possible. <br><br>Editing<br>Coffee and computer time, editing begins, always keeping your audience and the story arc front of mind, we create curiosity, laying down the audio, adding in the beautiful and flowing visuals, mixing pacing, matching music and colour correction. We then collaborate with you to discuss any changes.<br><br>Final Delivery<br>Always amazing to see a finished video coming together from just a few scribbles in a notepad. We send you the finished version for your website, instagram, presentation, youtube or wherever you need it. We also guide you on how to share your video so you can get the most out of it.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
