v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Video Production Cape Town – FAQs</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>What types of videos do you produce?<br>We create brand films, short-form social content, product showcases, interviews, behind-the-scenes, and campaign pieces.<br><br>Do you shoot on-location in Cape Town?<br>Yes. We shoot on location across Cape Town, from studio spaces to coastal cliffs, markets, maker workshops, and anywhere your story lives.<br><br>Do you work with international clients?<br>Absolutely. We regularly collaborate with teams based internationally looking for video production in Cape Town, <a href=\"video-production-south-africa.html\" class=\"text-info\">South Africa</a>.<br><br>How long does a project take?<br>Turnaround can range from 1 to 6 weeks depending on complexity, but we move quickly and communicate every step of the way.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
