   <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span><br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Video Production Lisbon Videos That People Remember</span></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline><br>3. Storytelling<br>By following a simple story arc, we highlight the ups and downs. Repeat the key ideas your audience needs to remember, and include personal moments that feel real, not generic. It works. Our videos have made people laugh, cry, and remember the people and places we capture.<br><br><i>“Katy did a superb job… creating an atmosphere which fully chimes with our target clientele. She was innovative and flexible… focused on getting the detail and message right.”<br>— Ginny Knox, Embo House<br></i><br><br>4. Every Detail Matters<br>We build a little world for your audience to step into. Colours, <a href=\"video-advice-natural-light.html\" class=\"text-info\">lighting</a>, <a href=\"video-advice-composition.html\" class=\"text-info\">framing</a>, sound are carefully considered. Think of it as a documentary mixed with a commercial. Real moments, but making sure everything looks good, tells your story clearly, and feels like your brand.<br><br>“The videos are so beautiful and capture the heart of Not I But We so well, you did an absolutely AMAZING job.”<br><i>— Madison Barefield, Not I But We</i></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
