v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Videographer Lisbon Locations&nbsp;</span></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Praça do Comércio<br>Sitting by the river this square mixes big, historic buildings with the busyness of the city.<br>Belém Tower<br>Historic landmark right on the water.<br>Alfama<br>Winding streets, colorful buildings, and lots of character.<br>Parque das Nações<br>Modern and riverside, this area works well for &nbsp;brand shoots.<br>Praia do Guincho<br>A wild beach just outside the city near Cascais.<br>LX Factory<br>An old industrial area turned creative hub.<br>Miradouro de São Pedro de Alcântara<br>A classic Lisbon viewpoint with sweeping city views. Ideal for cinematic shots by a Lisbon videographer.<br>Sintra’s Pena Palace<br>Colorful castle just outside Lisbon, looks like a fairytale.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
