ackground-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-10 align-center\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">How to Edit Videos for Social Media: A Step-by-Step Guide</h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\">\n                    Beautiful mobile websites\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Knowing how to edit <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/creators/\" class=\"text-info\">videos for social media</a> effectively is the difference between wasting your time and getting results. Editing social media videos isn’t just cutting clips, it’s about strategy, telling a story, pacing shots, knowing what to do with your audio, and creating eye catching visuals.<br><br>We're<a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-info\"> Katy and Eugene</a> two video creators with over 8 years experience. We love working with small businesses and grassroots organisations, but have also worked with larger brands like CNBC and the Obama Foundation.<br><br>Follow our clear process for rough cuts, B-roll, rhythm, contrast, and sound, and your videos will get peoples attention, keep viewers watching, and make your message clear and memorable.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
