v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">1. How to Edit Videos for Social Media: Pre-Production &amp; Filming</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Ok so firstly I would say you need to get your research, structure and filming in order first otherwise you're going to run into big problems. <br><br>So learning how to edit <a href=\"https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/video-marketing\" class=\"text-info\">videos for social media</a> starts here:<br><br>Know your audience: Make videos about things they actually care about, what do they like to see, what are they struggling with, how can you help.<br>Map out the story: Think about the story arc, hook - challenge - ups and downs - resolution.<br>Plan your shots: Mix wide, medium, and close-up angles. <a href=\"video-advice-natural-light.html\" class=\"text-info\">Keep lighting,</a> sound, and <a href=\"video-advice-composition.html\" class=\"text-info\">framing in mind</a>.<br>Capture real moments: Smiles, gestures, even little mistakes, they make your video feel human.<br>Bring extra energy: Cameras can flatten natural enthusiasm, so add a little extra energy.<br><br>Planning upfront makes editing social media videos way faster and gets you better results.<br><br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
