v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Sensitive Stories, Powerful Interviews: Our Cape Town Shoot</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>After Kruger, we headed to <a href=\"videographer-cape-town.html\" class=\"text-info\">Cape Town </a>to work with an <a href=\"brand-videographer.html\" class=\"text-info\">amazing brand</a>, Not I But We. Because it was a sensitive topic, some participants had to remain anonymous. I was a bit nervous as I usually focus on faces to create connection, but in the end, the interviews were so great, it really didn’t matter at all.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
