v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><br>Videographer London: Our Work</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>A great video isn’t just about looking nice, it’s about helping your business grow. A lot of videos don’t work because the messaging is off, that’s where we’re different.<br><br>1. We start with getting your messaging clear<br>As a videographer London, before we even pick up a camera, we take time to understand your business, your audience, and what you actually want to say.<br>So your video isn’t just beautiful, it makes sense, connects, and gives people a reason to care.<br><br>2. We make things look (and sound) really good<br>We care about the details, lighting, sound, colour, framing, all the things that make a video look beautiful!<br>Think documentary-style, but with an intentional finish.<br><br>3. We focus on story<br>People don’t remember information, they remember stories.<br>We shape your video around a simple story so it feels natural and actually sticks with people.<br><br>4. We keep it easy and stress-free<br>We know being on camera can feel awkward, so we create a relaxed environment where you can just be yourself. Behind the scenes, we handle everything, planning, filming, editing and keep you in the loop the whole way through.<br><br>5. We work in a way that fits you<br>Whether you need a one-off video or ongoing video content, we’ve got options:<br><br>Videography — One-off or multi-video shoots tailored to your brand<br>Social Media Packages — Regular content so you can show up consistently without the overwhelm<br>1:1 Video Coaching — Learn how to create your own videos with guidance from us</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
