          "_name": "header16",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"header1\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/background4.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#fffcfa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-10 align-center\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Our Video Production Process</h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\">\n                    Beautiful mobile websites\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">I used to think the video production process was all about your camera and filming, but I soon realised that’s just one part and if you don’t get those other parts in place, it’s unlikely you’ll have a great video.&nbsp;So here are the steps we follow to make sure every video is set up for success.<br><br>Wapping out the trusty notepad, we research what you are selling, how it helps people and who it's for? <br><br>Then planning, we take all this research and put it into a structure (hook, problem, solution and result) as well as planning all the details for filming, logistics, locations, equipment, shot lists and interview questions.<br><br>Up early for a day of filming, we carefully consider, framing, sound, lighting, colour whilst making you and your team feel as comfortable on camera as possible.&nbsp;<br><br>Coffee and computer time, editing begins, always keeping your audience and the story arc front of mind, we create curiosity, laying down the audio, adding in the beautiful and flowing visuals, mixing pacing, matching music and colour correction. We then collaborate with you to discuss any changes.<br><br>Always amazing to see a finished video coming together from just a few scribbles in a notepad. We send you the finished version for your website, instagram, presentation, youtube or wherever you need it. We also guide you on how to share your video so you can get the most out of it.<br><br>We create story filled videos that connect with the right people. Our documentary meets cinematic style tells your story in a down to earth human way, creating videos that keep working for you long after they're published. <br><br>We’ve been making videos for over 8 years with small businesses and grassroots organisations as well as with more well known brands like the Obama Foundation and CNBC. If you would like to work with us to tell your story through video you can contact me (Katy) here, <br><br>katy@munjiri.com<br><br></p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
