          "_name": "content5",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section content5\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background4.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#fffcfa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Our Video Production Process: Getting to Know You and Your Goals</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><div>Use Visuals to Tell Your Story</div></h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Notepad in hand, we focus on understanding your message, audience, and goals.<br>This part is can often be overlooked, but it's really important to get it in place.<br>We’ve seen many organisations invest in video without clearly defining what they want viewers to remember. Even high-quality footage struggles when the message isn’t clear.<br><br><b>Product: What Are You Selling?<br></b>One of the most common mistakes is trying to say too much in one video.<br>A strong video has one clear objective a service, a message, or a transformation. Everything else can come later. Whether it’s attracting clients, donors, or awareness, we define the single message that matters most.<br><br><b>Benefits: How Does It Help People?<br></b>People don’t really connect with products or services, they connect with what changes for them.<br>So we focus on what your work actually does for people:<br><br>What problem does it solve?<br>What changes because of it?<br>Why should anyone care?<br><br>For example, the product might be a piece of jewellery, but it's really about the story behind it, handmade, ethically made pieces that feel personal and unique. When that's clear, people are much more likely to pay attention and connect with it.<br><br><b>Audience: Who Is This For?<br></b>A video can’t speak to everyone, so it’s important to know who you’re talking to from the start. We identify your audience early on and shape the message and story around what matters most to them. Whether it's a social impact project that needs to connect with donors, communities, and stakeholders, or a business video aimed at potential customers.<br>&nbsp;<br><b>Finding the Human Story<br></b>Once people understand what you do, they want to understand who you are. The best moments often come when people stop performing and as cliche and annoying as it sounds are themselves.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
