v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Our Video Production Process: Planning<br></h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><div>Use Visuals to Tell Your Story</div></h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>This is where ideas become a practical video production plan, helping everything run smoothly on filming day / days and making the most of everyone’s time. <br><br>We often use a simple storytelling structure that guides viewers from interest to action:<br><br>Hook → Problem → Solution → Result<br>From there, we shape the video production around:<br>A strong opening that grabs attention<br>A relatable challenge or story<br>Clear benefits<br>Real proof through examples or testimonials<br>A simple next step for the viewer<br><br>As well as the structure our video production plan includes logisitics, locations, equipment, shot lists and interview questions.<br><br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
