v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Our Video Production Process: Filming</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><div>Use Visuals to Tell Your Story</div></h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>Filming is about much more than cameras and lighting. While we're constantly thinking about framing, sound, colour, lighting, and all the technical details behind the scenes, our real focus is creating an environment where people feel comfortable being themselves.<br><br>By the time the filming day comes around, everything is planned and prepared, allowing the process to feel relaxed and natural. Rather than worrying about what to say or how to act, you can focus on sharing your story and connecting with the people who matter most.<br><br>The most effective videos aren't about perfect performances, they're about making people care. When people speak from experience and focus on helping the viewer, their message feels more relatable and that's when people remember it.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
