   <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">How to Request RAW Files and What to Expect</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Bringing Your Brand to Life Through Video</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>If you still want the unedited assets for archiving or future editing, you can absolutely secure them. However, you must handle the request professionally and understand the industry standards.<br><br>Ask Before Signing the Contract<br>Never wait until after your event or shoot to ask for your unedited files. You should bring this up during your very first discovery call. A clean contract ensures that both parties agree on deliverables, copyright ownership, and usage rights before anyone presses the record button.<br><br>Prepare to Pay an Additional Fee<br>Because you are purchasing the raw intellectual property, most professionals charge an extra fee. This fee typically ranges from 20% to 50% of the total project cost. This cost covers the transfer time, the loss of potential future editing work, and the release of their unpolished media.<br><br>Provide Your Own Physical Storage<br>Do not expect a filmmaker to upload hundreds of gigabytes of data to a basic cloud folder. The standard practice is to purchase a high-capacity external hard drive or solid-state drive (SSD). You will need to mail or hand-deliver this physical drive directly to the videographer so they can transfer the massive files for you.<br></p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
