v class=\"title col-12 col-md-8\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-bold mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">What a videographer actually does (practically)</h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Here’s a more realistic breakdown of what businesses actually pay.</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-center mbr-white pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-article data-multiline>A good videographer is part storyteller, part strategist, part marketer, and part calm presence in the middle of your working day.<br>Our process usually looks like this.<br>1. Understanding your work<br>We start by listening, not just what you do, but why it matters to you and what makes your business different.<br>2. Planning without overcomplicating it<br>We shape your message so you don't feel like you need to perform for the camera.<br>We're also thinking about where the video will live, who it's for, and how it's most likely to connect with the people you want to reach.<br>3. Filming without intrusion<br>We don't take over your space we just guide the moments that already happening naturally.<br>4. Editing into something useful<br>We create videos that work online, for your website, social, email and for people finding you for the first time. So your work is understood clearly.</p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
